    <data key="d0">Benevity Centralized Logging Architecture with OpenSearch</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pk5yddJpC_8</data>
    <data key="d2">Benevity migrated from disjointed log destinations to a centralized OpenSearch architecture, cutting 16 hours/month of maintenance. Logs from EC2, Lambda, and Fargate pass through respective processors (Logstash, Lambda Processor, FluentBit) into OpenSearch, with access governed via Okta.</data>
    <data key="d3">Analytics &amp; Data Lakes, Security &amp; Identity</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
